              "y 795→873"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A call sign that's yours",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "b",
            "diffs": [
              "y 795→873"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Three to five letters, unique across the whole network. Pick it once: it can't change after you sign on.",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "p",
            "diffs": [
              "y 825→903"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "03",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "i",
            "diffs": [
              "y 907→985"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nothing that looks official",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "b",
            "diffs": [
              "y 907→985"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "No four-letter signs starting with K or W, which look like real FCC stations, and no network or brand names.",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "p",
            "diffs": [
              "y 936→1014"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "04",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "i",
            "diffs": [
              "y 1018→1096"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Hold one before you're ready",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "b",
            "diffs": [
              "y 1018→1096"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Reserve a call sign and a number on the waitlist. It's held for 120 days, with a reminder before it lapses.",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "p",
            "diffs": [
              "y 1048→1126"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "05",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "i",
            "diffs": [
              "y 1130→1208"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Sign off for good, and it's kept",
            "n": 0,
            "tag": "b",
            "diffs": [
              "y 1130→1208"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Your call sign stays yours for a year. The number goes back to the market after 90 days.",
